  "source_need": "Actual fixed333 Pillow/OpenJPEG2.5.4 raw J2K lossy samples differ3channels in the upstream float64 implementation. Source binary32 lifting/dequantization/ICT and lrint ties-even correct those without sample-specific branches.",
