    "from": "github.com/mububoki/jpeg2000",
    "to": "github.com/landuo/light-media-plugins/plugins/autosignin/imagehash/jpeg2000port"
  },
  "changes": [
    "Two irreversible decode arithmetic leaves follow OpenJPEG2.5.4 source operation boundaries and historic high-band scale.",
    "Tagtree encoder-only4methods removed to avoid bringing any writer endpoint/dependency.",
    "All other decoder Go files are byte-identical before module import relocation. No upstream writer/encoder/test/data/CLI/go.mod copied."
